#: scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af57ea4c3243a23e6de1ad40a7e0f45911ed59eb94bbda31dcb8949ddcb4cf79
#. default-sha256: f11b55124c274e9b0b99a50af60d6e801578172da28007fdf83682f7c1c4b70d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, now, Nellie.⟪k:1⟫You love the theatre, so don’t look so cross."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Allez, allez, Nellie.⟪k:1⟫Tu adores le théâtre, alors arrête de faire cette tête."

#: scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9113ccb3b403af1cedd0ab64ea2f50ac49448c50b08898eb1b58c5b9c2ac19ce
#. default-sha256: 2011b3e91a360e374b7c16857aace9e7b2165f115f4d37f9103ee50d7b3fa70f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmph."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Humpf."

#: scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41caa36bd02b362fb7da7ee35600d48ccb975b0966ea3550be04870e5c040690
#. default-sha256: f869fb982664c81ddf18a5be538da79413b3488439c006882a35fc688b6777c9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was out with a man other than her brother that evening—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a rare sight indeed. "
"⟪k:3⟫And she was quite clearly in a foul mood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie sortait avec un autre homme que son frère ce soir-là—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ une occasion "
"rarissime, il est vrai. ⟪k:3⟫Et elle était visiblement d’humeur massacrante."

#: scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c633c178155424d8c8a6c6dce3278e7f0c7b7f418612fb5c87f61920a1954d8
#. default-sha256: 8956201d93e7723a02b800de010f7acc04b0e9d5eb96bde3fc59da600a5d2d77
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I will ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ stand for this...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That I should have to marry a man as "
"disagreeable as Arthur!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫It’s unthinkable!)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Je ne tolèrerai ⟪k:1⟫pas⟪k:2⟫ cela...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Devoir me marier à un homme aussi "
"désagréable qu’Arthur !⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫C’est impensable !)"

#: scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e2dc1bb8d2807a5b175851a97c6fe9fa1193612a45494427fd38d0c2c4acae7
#. default-sha256: 64186625519097cb63be71ebb8f1f907363d8aa43809b84ebed8157110946050
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The young man at her side was Nellie’s fiancé, selected by her parents."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le jeune homme à ses côtés était le fiancé de Nellie choisi par ses parents."

#: scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ebf7acc1fbb5bb4de7bf2f26a7f56e9fd99bf093c360e9cd4745b7ff489561e
#. default-sha256: 1670f25280ec9a90e3599e9052f461fcc3b216e297807997b39cd5f2fb25112d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On any other occasion, she would have snubbed an invitation from any man who was not Mell, "
"but she had little say in this matter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En n’importe quelle autre occasion, elle aurait snobé l’invitation de tout homme autre que "
"Mell, mais là, elle n’avait pas eu droit au chapitre."

#: scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8db18c986649451f8b777a825556d20bdec61c6d48559a4fb5f23f1669bdfe2
#. default-sha256: 95ab9a366a647cc82419d29f4db3e67a3a417fea8d13d98de0adf986ba40a94f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was, for lack of a better word, ⟪k:1⟫forced⟪k:2⟫ to go out with him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle était, faute d’un meilleur mot, obligée de sortir avec lui."

#: scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45728c62d08f01fcddae6cd127fdfa2d793dd9a0bd1ac1f64a00c20ec7de4a68
#. default-sha256: 255147223533f3386c2b568804ef13db7b73adfabeb8d62efebb198d0d194c8e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And oh, how furiously she had fought against it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et comme elle s’était ô férocement battue contre cela !"

#: scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 472416360ac66c7dd5115a26eb801223bb469cf1b1d1d55e4b481bc5ceeffa87
#. default-sha256: 29339abae09d4f3d77c97aa99c5cc742fb02d313fc9ea60e01000f7dbc5c1777
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had shoved aside the abigail trying to fasten her corset, locked herself in her room, "
"and sobbed for quite some time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle avait repoussé la soubrette qui essayait de lui attacher son corset, s’était enfermée "
"dans sa chambre et avait sangloté pendant un bon moment."

#: scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fabedbff84e29703c82ea96df1b029336d7e8443fd2f81e7ec87c8df8246e3b2
#. default-sha256: 3970706167b2b497770da48a85029a4b70e2efe35ecc290864d8b86effb16836
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It required the combined efforts of several of us to get her ready and out the door for her "
"date."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nous dûmes nous y mettre à plusieurs pour la préparer à temps pour son rendez-vous."

#: scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 711c6c0f7d78c65f281e12a5902df4acaafb6caafe6bbcd030d1886fd0fb2ce2
#. default-sha256: 5c4f13e26349aa995a5cf876e3ca18f27b76b96406955993d27a1b0d29b66937
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Come now, you should at least ⟪k:4⟫pretend⟪k:5⟫ you’re enjoying yourself.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Or do you want people to think we don’t get along?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Allez, c’est bon, tu pourrais au moins faire semblant de t’amuser.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"Ou bien tu veux que les gens pensent qu’on ne s’entend pas ?"

#: scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfcfb930569efef2186a6125821f2b62dce1e5a99917e5bfbea420fc043214d5
#. default-sha256: ba1289dadb6a8b56ece75ec51b9e07ba6c71a76abad18864e4ee78892bca8237
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do⟪k:3⟫ we get along?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’est pourtant la vérité, non ?"

#: scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6dd9bd219c430aad7ed5ea1f0d9a10da9c2050ac25b8b601a149ebcd5cdfb61b
#. default-sha256: 274de3db1fedac6078ca1768405b923c7c96b6091ea25f367579459404a9ca2f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well... ⟪k:3⟫I want to, for what it’s worth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eh bien... ⟪k:3⟫j’aimerais que tout se passe bien entre nous, pour ce que ça vaut."

#: scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb3e1ec2f8d9f95ce7e36ebc92ca9daa27e00330acf440ebbdf1ac3c7ab283dd
#. default-sha256: c389beedcf0e46c87a94d70da786047689b973e87573ee61a550269e4523de0b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What it’s “worth” to you is my ⟪k:2⟫name⟪k:3⟫, not me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ce qui « vaut » pour toi, c’est mon ⟪k:2⟫nom⟪k:3⟫, pas moi."

#: scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb6495dbf5ce4ad3e2475f61209af0eeae234046e02920f44a445a0d854fb67d
#. default-sha256: 830e48d0fcaf69d5963814f70b8d2fe7adb002f8cea2e9046933c1815f27b8d5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you really going to be like that?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I went out of my way to take you to "
"your favorite play.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The least you could do is be a little kinder to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu veux vraiment jouer à cela ?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Je me suis démené pour t’emmener voir ta "
"pièce préférée.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Le moins que tu puisses faire, c’est te montrer un brin plus gentille."

#: scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c606f67bb564281064fb0ef87dbc3148c8eb799d443d21c6ffba40a8d107763
#. default-sha256: 48122191c857dfe474e367d7aa1cab66eecba6bf0869416312dd0498b5c8c4bc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What was it called again... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Romeo and Juliet⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫It’s been running for six "
"or seven years now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comment ça s’appelle, déjà... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Roméo et Juliette⟪k:3⟫ ?⟪k:4⟫Ça fait six ou sept ans "
"qu’ils la jouent."

#: scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a5bce108de066952cd00366a8e74bb4dd4346bae9781fbe311c9e47a7fb3bee
#. default-sha256: 00f5b94ea066b320e5a685dee81197625b54bde17a276559a7888e6b41f56c9d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A family like yours or mine could pay to have a brand new script written."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Une famille comme la tienne ou la mienne pourrait commander un tout nouveau scénario."

#: scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8ac72c99cb5c95a63ae04803177bb918297ada1662a4ac907477353ac64c885
#. default-sha256: 2a187d3bd59ea62eae857c0da4c4ef3d31a44cf68bb15b19ab912c957aae42a2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So why should we have to see an old play at a theatre full of ⟪k:1⟫commoners⟪k:2⟫? ⟪k:3⟫It "
"may be private, but even so... ⟪k:4⟫Haah... ⟪k:5⟫I would rather just have a show put on at my "
"estate—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pourquoi donc devrions-nous aller voir une vieille pièce dans un théâtre rempli de "
"roturiers ? ⟪k:1⟫Il a beau être privé, c’est quand même... ⟪k:2⟫Aah... ⟪k:3⟫je préfèrerais donner "
"le spectacle à mon domaine—"

#: scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f924d1466c4e1944a1d5b6c527b659e3fcb428549e9afe07322bb3c43e2de53e
#. default-sha256: a20f073f869f2ce245e80a61bc69aac8470288fb6d49a070d4c0029dda2bad72
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Stop talking already!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tais-toi immédiatement !"

#: scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 393efa3bd542c36d0f5a0de04d01793dc2b14071c4b6e02c116aa5116aed3f94
#. default-sha256: 69020d5e613eb6e025a1c4412e1059036af4a46dac387e8fa227b7bf3fc7e944
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why should I— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Why should I have to marry someone like you?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I have "
"ab-⟪k:6⟫so-⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫lutely⟪k:9⟫ no desire to marry you!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pourquoi devrais-je— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫pourquoi devrais-je me marier avec quelqu’un comme toi ?!"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Je n’ai ⟪k:6⟫ab-⟪k:7⟫so-⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫lu-⟪k:10⟫ment⟪k:11⟫ pas envie de me marier avec toi !"

#: scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c40821145c7dbe73fc20657df518dab2315993a29c8e7d992777fcaa1558747d
#. default-sha256: 25a2ead4c5aa101c90a03251e2cd1e04d77386f17818901cefb5e4671057222f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whatever it takes, I ⟪k:1⟫will⟪k:2⟫ put a stop to this!⟪k:3⟫I’ll talk to Father as many "
"times as I must!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quel que soit le temps que cela prendra, j’y mettrai le holà !⟪k:1⟫Je parlerai à Père autant "
"de fois qu’il le faudra !"

#: scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9a61510070c647e488c53733a9c63d9c209a65f7a1bc416a568a7775c019462
#. default-sha256: 4e61a66ff961cbc8632b08026204f7aa363fc24cdfa6ae05deb8c20b1347c011
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Please, don’t make such a scene. It’s shameful.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There are people around; "
"remember, you represent your family."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je t’en prie, ne me fais pas une scène. Quelle honte.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫On n’est pas tout "
"seul ; rappelle-toi, tu représentes ta famille."

#: scenario:scenario_406485EF_FA15_4EBC_8C65_EE46A5C1DA53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d321075b02643fdfad57a94a02777cca2a882854a40fa6cfb4adf4dbd649fd6a
